<title>BERMUDA: ADT drops plans to sell U.S auction business.</title>
<headline>ADT drops plans to sell U.S auction business.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADT Ltd said Monday it has cancelled its previously announced plans to sell its United States vehicle auction business.</p>
<p>At the same time, the company said it has terminated its market purchase program of ADT Operations Inc. Liquid Yield Option Notes due 2010.</p>
</text>
